<title>UK: DNIB sets 150 million Swiss franc Dec 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>DNIB sets 150 million Swiss franc Dec 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DE NATIONALE INVESTERINGSBANK (DNIB)</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     2.0	 MATURITY    18.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.60     PAY DATE   S28.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  STD	 LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   18.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA+   DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS US/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SWISS     HOME CTRY  N/LANDS   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		THERE IS A REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
